    "rating": 4.8,
    "reference": "ChIJK_kahvNJyUwRM1kp3DTbGMQ",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mona",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106183423978679416295/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJXKbNttlW8ULY6MHEJY7VOsdmYTlq-QK88z2HCoWAaKFBC4w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "My daughter-in-law is very picky and I never go wrong with her taste and recommendations, so it was with very little concern that I followed her example and entrusted House of Chef James Mitchell with my own Christmas order this year. Their level of customer service and quality of ingredients are, I believe, the key to their success. While I am a huge fan of local businesses and try to support them whenever I can, I would say this is well worth your drive to St-Lazare no matter what part of the city you live in. And before you think that a charcuterie platter is not the most exciting thing in the world, let me respectfully correct you: THIS charcuterie platter is so special it has its own name: GRAZING PLATTER! It is not the cheapest one you will ever find, but it is most definitely the BEST you will ever find, anywhere. Every morsel is exquisite! A MUST!!!\n\nTheir website is super user-friendly and if any questions, you contact them and Danai (pronounced Dana) will be so helpful, you too will make this your go-to for all your catering needs, from weekly menus to special events, to the Holidays. Absolutely topnotch, compared to any caterer anywhere.",
        "time": 1766859662,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sara Del Fabbro",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100618012824990298834/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6VrW2XLR9Ol0v1auAeTJ6RPCzqLlenRRJUKdBac40S4opHA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We couldn't be happier with our experience with House of Chef James Mitchel! The food was absolutely outstanding — our guests are still raving about how delicious everything was. Every dish was beautifully presented and full of flavor.\n\nThe coordination on the day of our wedding was flawless. The team was professional, organized, and clearly experts in their field. Everything ran smoothly from start to finish.\n\nA heartfelt thank you to Chef James Mitchel and Danai for their exceptional service, warmth, and attention to detail. You made our day feel effortless, and we’re truly grateful.\n\nHighly recommended to anyone looking for top-tier catering and impeccable service!",
        "time": 1756820167,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Paul Stephanou",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101200531878236751659/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVC8N58aMWsjeoYK-BhdRMzgi3Cpj0VwZIXF4vw3OPmXuCEEpV_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "My husband and I must say, the catering service the appetizers,the array of flavours, OMG Amazing!!!! provided by Chef James Mitchel and Danai Alexopoulos for our daughter-in-law's bridal shower was truly exceptional. As a caterer myself, I know how challenging it is to get every detail just right, but Danai and Chef James took care of every aspect with utmost professionalism.\n\nFrom the presentation of the food to the service she even made frozen paper towels for guests and handed them out herself and made sure everyone was hydrated .. THATS SERVICE , it was a very very hot day . Danai was extremely detail-oriented, ensuring that every element was executed flawlessly. We are very meticulous and like things done a certain way, but these two professionals handled everything with such skill and finesse. From beginning to end, they made sure our daughter-in-law Jessica's bridal shower was a memorable event that people are still raving about.\n\nIf you're looking for an event catered and you want it done right with attention to detail like you've never seen, we highly recommend Danai Alexopoulos & Chef James Mitchel. They made our special day for Jessica, whom we consider like our own daughter, one to remember forever.\n\nHuge thanks to the house Chef James Mitchel  for making this happen so elegantly. We cannot recommend them enough.\nThis was an exceptional experience\nCan’t wait for our next event to work together again 💕\n\nCheers 🥂\nArtemis & Paul",
        "time": 1756035431,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kelly Sheehy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102265635178007840855/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKMyPREFKOAqyZWSgDkWF9qTvl6KRq8ixxl2N_TyUH-DcaSpA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "I had Chef James Mitchell inc create a special catered menu for a Luau we threw. The food was great, everyone raved and asked where it was from. Not only was the food prepped and ready to go, there was a slight delay with some of the food being ready so they actually went out of their way to deliver it to our house along with another variation of one of the dishes which was awesome! They went out of their way to ensure our event went off without a hitch. Can not recommend them enough",
        "time": 1752688428,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marta WR",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106326215965130777168/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV-MBGpjn5y22b6A1KKgEWgNANP63QWMzQjmWiQhKohGkRh-gh34A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Just wanted to say a big thank you to the team at House of Chef James Mitchell for making my little girls birthday so fun and seamless. From initial discussion through going over the activities, sharing advice and answering my questions I felt looked after, welcome and confident that this party would be a blast! And it totally was! All the guests had a wonderful time at my daughter’s 7th and fully enjoyed the activity with so much passion and focus. Thank you so much for sharing your space with us! We loved it, birthday girl and her friends had an awesome time and left with delicious (and totally cute) cakes. Big thank you to Sarah for being such a rock star, so engaging, funny and patient. We had a great time and loved your space for our Hawaiian birthday !!! We will be back 💕",
        "time": 1743380187,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
